 r"The note mentions a similar work of Brin presented in the seminar around a date transcribed as 1946, adding that its limiting meaning is unknown.",
 r"No exact author identity, publication, formula, or limit problem can be fixed from this sentence. The date and surname must remain diplomatic evidence pending identification; they do not define a separate mathematical conjecture.",
